ard?"},{"t":[91,92.8],"en":"Ah, well, no. It's just, uh, me and Wendy."},{"t":[94.2,96.2],"en":"Wendy? That sounds like a girl's name."},{"t":[97.5,99.6],"en":"It is. Did I not tell you about her?"},{"t":[100.4,103],"en":"Mm-hmm. About the time you told me about New Year's Eve."},{"t":[103.8,104.9],"en":"Where is everybody else?"},{"t":[105.7,106.5],"en":"I sent them home."},{"t":[107.1,109.3],"en":"Oh, you are such a good boss."},{"t":[109.6,110.4],"en":"Is she pretty?"},{"t":[112.8,115.6],"en":"Uh, uh, answer faster, answer faster."},{"t":[116.3,117],"en":"I don't know."},{"t":[117.3,118.7],"en":"Answer better, answer better."},{"t":[120.2,121.7],"en":"I don't think of her that way, you know?"},{"t":[121.8,123],"en":"I mean, she's a, uh, she's a colleague."},{"t":[123.5,124.3],"en":"What does she do there?"},{"t":[124.7,126.1],"en":"Oh, she's regional vice president."},{"t":[126.3,127.6],"en":"She's just below me."},{"t":[127.9,128.7],"en":"She did what?"},{"t":[133.6,135.1],"en":"Below me."},{"t":[137.6,138.4],"en":"Uh, wait."},{"t":[138.5,140.1],"en":"Is Wendy the runner-up Miss Oklahoma?"},{"t":[140.8,141.3],"en":"What?"},{"t":[143.5,144.7],"en":"Well, she, she didn't win."},{"t":[147.1,148.9],"en":"All right, well, maybe I should let you"},{"t":[148.9,151],"en":"and the second prettiest girl in Oklahoma"},{"t":[151,151.9],"en":"get back to work."},{"t":[152.2,153.7],"en":"Well, second prettiest that year."},{"t":[153.8,155.5],"en":"I mean, of all the girls in Oklahoma,"},{"t":[155.6,156.5],"en":"she's probably..."},{"t":[156.5,157.6],"en":"Oh, Chandler, stop talking."},{"t":[160.1,162.4],"en":"Honey, there's really nothing to worry about."},{"t":[163,163.3],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[164,164.6],"en":"I'm serious."},{"t":[165.3,165.7],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[166.9,167.6],"en":"Merry Christmas."},{"t":[168.4,169.1],"en":"Merry Christmas."},{"t":[169.9,171.1],"en":"Merry Christmas, you guys."},{"t":[171.7,172.1],"en":"Merry Christmas."},{"t":[172.1,173.6],"en":"Blah, blah, 